/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defend Your Farm from Mischievous Critters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more your farm grows, the more determined the critters become! These little troublemakers will stop at nothing to snatch your crops and animals, but with a combination of defensive plants, powerful livestock, and quick reflexes, you can keep them at bay. Set up strategic defenses, unlock new tools, and upgrade your farm’s protection to withstand waves of hungry critters!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548790/extras/8b10c402a2fa1c69bff723827fa181e9.poster.avif?t=1766037298\" width=640 height=524 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548790/extras/8b10c402a2fa1c69bff723827fa181e9.webm?t=1766037298\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548790/extras/8b10c402a2fa1c69bff723827fa181e9.mp4?t=1766037298\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harvest, Cook, and Sell Your Creations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve defended your crops, bring in the harvest and use your fresh ingredients to whip up delicious dishes! From farm-fresh meals to gourmet feasts, every dish you make can be sold to customers for cash. The more you sell, the more upgrades you can unlock to expand your farm and kitchen empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Cooking Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Unique Recipes</strong> – Discover new dishes as you grow different crops and livestock!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell to Customers</strong> – Earn money by serving up tasty meals made from your farm’s ingredients!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Kitchen</strong> – Improve your cooking tools for faster meal preparation!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand, Upgrade, and Master the Wild Roots World!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you’ll unlock new farmlands, rare plants with stronger abilities, and advanced tools to make farming and cooking easier. Customize your farm, experiment with different plant and animal combinations, and become the ultimate farm-chef-defender!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your land</strong> – Clear trees and rocks to make room for more crops and animals!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your defenses</strong> – Strengthen your plants and livestock to fend off bigger critters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the balance</strong> – Farm, cook, and defend to become the best in Wild Roots!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are You Ready to Farm, Cook, and Defend?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Wild Roots: Chef vs Critters</strong>, you’re not just a farmer—you’re a defender, a chef, and a strategist. Grow powerful crops, raise protective livestock, and battle waves of mischievous critters while cooking up the best farm-fresh meals. Can you build the ultimate farm and keep it safe from the wild? It’s time to dig in and find out!</p>",
